<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/EL1/current/>
        rdf:type                skos:Collection;
        rdfs:comment            "Group set up under the joint auspices of the SeaDataNet project and the Intergovernmental Oceanographic Commission MarineXML Steering Group for controlled vocabulary governance in the marine domain";
        rdfs:seeAlso            <https://github.com/nvs-vocabs/EL1>;
        dc:alternative          "Platform Event Actions";
        dc:creator              "SeaDataNet and MarineXML Vocabulary Content Governance Group";
        dc:date                 "2022-12-17 02:00:01.0";
        dc:description          "Terms used to identify actions performed on sampling and observation platforms. This vocabulary is the result of an harmonisation exercise between the Eurofleets Automatic Reporting System (EARS) ontology and the Rolling Deck to Repository (R2R) project, for research vessel event logs. The terms it contains should be applicable to any sampling or observation platforms.";
